Cell["\<\
An undriven two-level Hamiltonian is recovered from its three-sector Floquet \
representation.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->552919480,ExpressionUUID->"81c788a9-02df-1a40-8d8a-ddb429b4d029"],

